## Interface: 120100
## Title: MaxDps Bridge Exp
## Notes: Experimental in-game-config fork of MaxDpsBridge. Owns its toggles (overlay-wins, SlotAllowed gate), adds a RICE-style insecure overlay, a 6-tab Settings canvas and /mdbx. Mutually exclusive with the stable MaxDpsBridge: if the stable bridge is loaded this addon stays inert. No secure templates, no protected Lua. Same additive protocol v5 wire as the stable bridge plus the Ext4 hotbar-map block (51-cell strip; version nibble stays 5).
